# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CA Platform — web (public site, port 3000)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Every variable here is validated by
# `src/lib/env.ts` at module load, so a missing or malformed value fails the
# build loudly instead of rendering an empty page in production.
#
# This app has NO authentication (CLAUDE.md §3.7). It holds no credential that
# identifies a user, and it must never be given one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Public origin of this site. Drives `metadataBase`, canonicals, sitemap and
# JSON-LD `@id`s, so it must be the real scheme+host with no trailing slash.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# SERVER-ONLY. Base URL of the FastAPI backend, no trailing slash, no version
# prefix (`/api/v1` is appended by src/lib/fetcher.ts). Never prefixed with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ — the browser must never learn where the API lives, because the
# browser never calls it.
API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# SERVER-ONLY. Shared secret the backend presents to POST /api/revalidate when
# content is published. **Must be at least 32 characters** — `src/lib/env.ts`
# rejects anything shorter at module load, so a short value fails the build
# rather than the first publish.
#
#   openssl rand -hex 32
#
# **Write the same value into backend/.env as WEB_REVALIDATE_SECRET.** If the
# two differ the webhook is rejected with 401 and publishing silently stops
# reaching the website until the ISR window expires (CLAUDE.md §3.10a).
REVALIDATE_SECRET=replace-me-with-at-least-32-random-characters
